Tiger Class Drive User Stories
Draft for Group Review


As a [persona], I want [goal], so that [reason].... etall

Story 1:
As a student I want to compare my schedules options by total credit hours and days on campus and gaps between classes so that I can choose a manageable schedule that makes good use of time.
Story 2:
As a Lsu student I wanted to view available sections and their associated lectures, labs and recitations, so that I can choose a complete set of class meeetings that fit my schedule.
story 3:
As a Lsu student I want to save my GPA completed credit hours and completed courses so that I do not have to enter them every time I plan a semester.
Story 4:
As a lsu student I want to add recurring work, club and personal commitments so that I can plan my classes around my other responsibilities.
Story 5:
As a lsu student I want to compare course prerequisistes with my completed courses, so that I can identify requirementes I sitll need to meet or verify that I have.
Story 6:
AS a computer sciecene student I want to see which degree requirement category a course will satisfy so that I can understand how it fits into my degree plan.
Story 7:
As a student something I want is to save, reopen, edit, and compare different grade scenarios so that I can explore possible outcomes without starting over.
Story 8:
As an student I want to be able to find my friends by username and send and accept request and remove friends so that I can control who I coordinate my schedule with.
Story 9: 
As a friend I want to compare my schedule with one of my friends schedule to see shared classes and common free periods of at least 30 mintues within a time range so I can choose and we can plan time and classes together.
Story 10:
As a student I want to see scheduling conflicts and hide sections that overlap my commitments so that I can choose classes I can attend.
Story 11:
As a student I want to be able to create an account and log in so that I can return my saved semester plans.
Story 12:
As a lsu student, I want to be able to enter possible course grades and see my projected semester and cumulative GPA so that I can understand how these grades could affect my academic progress.
Story 13:
As a Lsu student I want to share a selected schedule while keeping GPA or commitement details private so that I stay in control of my infromation.
Story 14:
As a Lsu student I want to set my preferred earliest and lastest class times so I can find my schedules that match my daily rountine.
Story 15:
As a lsu student I want to see the semester gpa I need to reach my target cumulative gpa so that I can set a realistic academic goal.


